### 1.1 Seeder - Créer 10 wallets
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/seed?numWallets=10&eventsPerWallet=100

### 1.2 Créer un wallet spécifique
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "phoneNumber": "+221770000001",
  "email": "client1@test.com",
  "initialBalance": 100000,
  "code": "WLT-0000001",
  "currency": "XOF"
}

### 1.3 Créer un deuxième wallet
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "phoneNumber": "+221770000002",
  "email": "client2@test.com",
  "initialBalance": 50000,
  "code": "WLT-0000002",
  "currency": "XOF"
}

### 1.4 Seeder les factures dans payment-service
POST http://localhost:8081/api/factures/seed
Content-Type: application/json
["WLT-0000001", "WLT-0000002", "WLT-0000003", "WLT-0000004", "WLT-0000005"]

### 1.5 Faire un dépôt (pour avoir des transactions)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/1/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "amount": 50000,
  "paymentMethod": "CASH"
}

### 1.6 Faire un transfert (pour avoir plus de transactions)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wallets/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "senderPhone": "+221770000001",
  "receiverPhone": "+221770000002",
  "amount": 10000
}